			"name": "Guns",
			"local_notes": "Lore: The shuriken catapult is standard Guardian issue, per framework.md's Aeldari gear anchor.\n\nDesign: DX+2 (16) for 4 points, Easy (B170); this project's weapon-skill table treats shuriken catapults as autogun-pattern for skill purposes.",
			"tags": [
